            "review_title": "Review at Quan Nem 52",
            "review_text": "VietHungryBoy\nBowral, Australia113 contributions\n0\nSimple Home Cooking- Yummy\nMar 2018 • Friends\nMy first night in Nha Trang and I was taken here by locals. The restaurant looks like most in Vietnam where the front is the restaurant while upstair is their living quarters. The food came out quickly. I especially liked the Banh Xeo which has a crispy shell and with the added herbs and sauce I devoured 2 in no time.Unfortunately the the pickled pork devon was not quite ready so tasted more sweet than sour salty sweet. The fried spring roll was tasty as I was expecting. I was a satisfying dinner and very inexpensive.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 29, 2018",
